      <trans-unit id="cached.intro" datatype="html">
        <source> Server-rendered from KV. This response is cached at the edge for 5 minutes. Edit the entity at <x id="START_LINK" ctype="x-a" equiv-text="&lt;a
            [routerLink]=&quot;[&apos;/admin&apos;, id()]&quot;
            class=&quot;text-(--accent) underline underline-offset-2&quot;
            &gt;"/>/admin/<x id="INTERPOLATION" equiv-text="{{ id() }}"/><x id="CLOSE_LINK" ctype="x-a" equiv-text="&lt;/a
          &gt;"/> to trigger an automatic purge. </source>
        <target> Renderizado en el servidor desde KV. Esta respuesta se almacena en la caché del borde durante 5 minutos. Edita la entidad en <x id="START_LINK" ctype="x-a" equiv-text="&lt;a
            [routerLink]=&quot;[&apos;/admin&apos;, id()]&quot;
            class=&quot;text-(--accent) underline underline-offset-2&quot;
            &gt;"/>/admin/<x id="INTERPOLATION" equiv-text="{{ id() }}"/><x id="CLOSE_LINK" ctype="x-a" equiv-text="&lt;/a
          &gt;"/> para activar una purga automática. </target>
      </trans-unit>
